    lt:disruptionReason "FERNBROOK ROAD, SE13: Until early October 2026, route 273 is on diversion in both directions via Leahurst Road and Fernbrook Crescent due to station improvement works taking place at Fernbrook Road. Bus stops 'Hither Green Station' (U and Z) and 'Fernbrook Crescent' (V and Y) will not be served. For journeys towards Petts Wood please use the temporary stop outside The Station Hotel. For journeys towards Lewisham please use the temporary stop outside “Stanford Estates”. Allow extra time for your journey." ;
