    lt:disruptionReason "QUEENS ROAD, SE14: From 08:00 on Monday 30 March until 17:00 on Friday 10 April ROUTES 36 136 171 436 N89 N136 and N171 will be on diversion towards Queen's Park, Elephant & Castle, Battersea, Trafalgar Square, Oxford Circus and Tottenham Court Road due to electrical works. Buses will divert via Old Kent Road, Mandela Way, Peckham Park Road, and Peckham Hill Street, missing the stops from 'New Cross Fire Station' to 'Carlton Grove'. Please allow extra time for your journey." ;
